  "msc-math-done" [label="PROJECT DONE\nmsc-math\nBLOCKED", shape=doubleoctagon, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Project completion requires supported and readable selected thesis claims, truthful code/data/reproduction and availability promises, a frozen candidate meeting the recorded human PASS threshold, required delivery/archive dispositions, and released assignments. This map does not assert any present whole-project readiness.\nblocker: Workflow implementation/acceptance, thesis source/support/human PASS, code/evidence and reproduction checks, actual delivery/archive dispositions and final session release remain unfinished.\nplan_gap: Source-backed completion model needs Jörn’s selection of bounded execution windows. Current administrative status is unknown; the scientific synthesis remains a dated unreconciled 25 September snapshot.\nproject: msc-math\nauthorization: Outcome map selected; thesis execution and external delivery are not authorized.\nnext_step: Use the project branches to select useful bounded work in separate worktrees; do not restart the stopped thesis run automatically.\nSources: docs/coordination/thesis-work.md, docs/coordination/handoff.md, docs/project-facts.md, ARCHITECTURE.md", penwidth=2, fontsize=14];
