  "workflow-delivery" [label="Selected package\ndelivered\nBLOCKED", shape=box, fillcolor="#fce9e5", color="#ba6251", tooltip="Integrate the selected project-local skills, discovery adapters and other concrete workflow deliverables; retain explicitly accepted deferrals for additional capabilities. Assign owned implementation steps and checks after selection. Plans alone cannot close delivery.\nblocker: No implementation/activation package selected; selected communication acceptance is unfinished. Dashboard/map delivery is complete; historical transport cause can remain unknown.\nplan_gap: Implementation owners, concrete change list and receiving/review responsibilities must follow selection. This placeholder does not authorize migration, evaluations or host/cloud setup.\nproject: workflows\nauthorization: Only the recorded selected assignment is authorized; future activation/execution remains separately selected.\nSources: docs/coordination/skill-migration-plan.md, docs/coordination/knowledge-evaluation-plan.md"];
